Package: winpipe
Title: Interface to Windows Named Pipes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jonas", "Lieth", , "jonas.lieth@gesis.org", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides support for Windows Named Pipes for inter-process
    communication through the 'Win32' C++ API. Allows to create, connect,
    disconnect, read from, and write to server and client pipes as standard
    R connections. Includes convenience utilities to parse and build
    Access Control List (ACL) security descriptors. HTTP requests are
    indirectly supported via background relay servers.
URL: https://github.com/jslth/winpipe, https://jslth.github.io/winpipe/
BugReports: https://github.com/jslth/winpipe/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
OS_type: windows
